# Files outside tools/ that a cargo suite binary embeds at compile time with
# include_str! or include_bytes!. One repo-relative path prefix per line.
# `ways manage update` reads this file from the pulled checkout and counts a
# change under a listed prefix as binary source, so a release that adds an
# embedded file is classified by its own list. The update test
# embedded_assets_outside_tools_are_classified fails when an include that
# escapes tools/ is missing here.
hooks/memory-seed/
attend/sensors/
